# Optional: GitHub Personal Access Token (no scopes needed for public data).
# Without this, the app still works but is limited to 60 requests/hour
# (unauthenticated). With it, the limit rises to 5000 requests/hour.
#
# Generate one at: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# (classic token, no scopes selected, is enough for public repo/read access)
#
# SECURITY NOTE: This is a Vite app, so anything prefixed VITE_ is bundled
# into the client-side JavaScript and is visible to anyone who opens dev
# tools on the deployed site. Do NOT use a token with write/admin scopes
# here. This is fine for a personal-use/demo rate-limit bump, but is not
# a substitute for a real backend if this app ever needed a secret that
# actually mattered. See README "Technical Decisions" for more.
VITE_GITHUB_TOKEN=
